WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,650 --> 00:00:02,850
Are you still spitting meat?

2
00:00:02,850 --> 00:00:04,250
You are becoming more and more rude

3
00:00:04,250 --> 00:00:05,730
I picked coconuts all day today

4
00:00:05,730 --> 00:00:06,730
My hands are worn out

5
00:00:06,730 --> 00:00:09,210
Xue Ya said that we have to deduct rice from our supply line, so what?

6
00:00:09,210 --> 00:00:11,330
So what kind of work can I do if I come to work in exchange for food?

7
00:00:11,330 --> 00:00:13,170
If you want to become a private person, consult with others first.

8
00:00:14,740 --> 00:00:15,740
So positive today

9
00:00:15,740 --> 00:00:17,100
Anyway, I’m doing it for Xue Ya

10
00:00:17,100 --> 00:00:18,580
At least I'll be full if I fuck you

11
00:00:21,270 --> 00:00:22,470
Are you still short of people here?

12
00:00:22,470 --> 00:00:23,710
Lack of capable people

13
00:00:23,710 --> 00:00:24,670
No shortage of young ladies

14
00:00:24,670 --> 00:00:25,990
What am I doing now?

16
00:00:32,300 --> 00:00:33,860
I'm afraid you'll be in danger alone

17
00:00:33,860 --> 00:00:35,580
Just come over and see what happens tonight

18
00:00:35,580 --> 00:00:37,660
Don't tell anyone, I will keep it a secret

19
00:00:40,170 --> 00:00:41,570
Sure enough, we're already online

20
00:00:42,090 --> 00:00:48,260
Then I have to hurry up, Xiao Mian

21
00:00:48,260 --> 00:00:49,860
It doesn't matter what you are doing standing there.

22
00:00:49,860 --> 00:00:50,900
I'm organizing things

23
00:00:50,900 --> 00:00:52,780
Instead of exposing her, it's better to learn first

24
00:00:52,780 --> 00:00:54,300
How did she get these things?
